#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:568
msgid "Allowed tags"
msgstr "Etiquetas permitidas"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:571
msgid ""
"Comma-separated. The engine can only use tags from this list (max 7 per "
"post)."
msgstr ""
"Separados por comas. El motor solo puede usar etiquetas de esta lista "
"(máximo 7 por publicación)."

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:581
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "Programación"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:588
msgid "First date/time"
msgstr "Primera fecha/hora"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:591
msgid ""
"If left empty, generation starts immediately. If you set a date/time, the "
"first post is scheduled and the next ones follow the interval."
msgstr ""
"Si se deja vacío, la generación comienza inmediatamente. Si establece una "
"fecha/hora, la primera publicación se programa y las siguientes siguen el "
"intervalo."

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:592
msgid ""
"Past dates are allowed: WordPress will publish immediately using the "
"selected historical date."
msgstr ""
"Se permiten fechas pasadas: WordPress publicará inmediatamente utilizando la "
"fecha histórica seleccionada."

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:596
msgid "Interval between publications (days)"
msgstr "Intervalo entre publicaciones (días)"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:602
msgid "Posts per background chunk"
msgstr "Publicaciones por fragmento de fondo"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:609
msgid ""
"Controls how many posts are generated before the checkpoint resumes. Higher "
"values reduce resumes but increase timeout risk; use 1 on shared hosting and "
"2-3 on stable servers."
msgstr ""
"Controla cuántas entradas se generan antes de reanudar el punto de control. "
"Los valores más altos reducen las reanudaciones, pero aumentan el riesgo de "
"tiempo de espera; usa 1 en alojamiento compartido y 2-3 en servidores "
"estables."

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:614
msgid "CRON: fill pending"
msgstr "CRON: relleno pendiente"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:617
msgid "Enable CRON for pending images"
msgstr "Habilite CRON para imágenes pendientes"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:617
msgid "Runs hourly pending-image filling."
msgstr "Ejecuta el llenado de imágenes pendientes cada hora."

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:628
msgid "Scheduling and queue checkpoint"
msgstr "Punto de control de programación y cola"

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:628
msgid ""
"Automatic scheduling, interval chaining and checkpoint status are available "
"in Pro only."
msgstr ""
"La programación automática, el encadenamiento de intervalos y el estado de "
"los puntos de control solo están disponibles en Pro."

#: includes/admin/views/blog.php:639
msgid ""
